  "len": 24,
  "en": "",
  "status": "todo",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 4114,
  "text_len": 21
 },
 {
  "id": "sce373:01034",
  "jp": "トウヤ「あ、あれは‥‥」",
  "off": 4148,
  "len": 17,
  "en": "",
  "status": "todo",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 4150,
  "text_len": 14
 },
 {
  "id": "sce373:01048",
  "jp": "アイ「レイオード！」",
  "off": 4168,
  "len": 15,
  "en": "",
  "status": "todo",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 4170,
  "text_len": 12
 },
 {
  "id": "sce373:0105A",
  "jp": "ベルンスト（‥‥やはりきましたか‥‥）",
  "off": 4186,
  "len": 26,
  "en": "",
  "status": "todo",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 4188,
  "text_len": 23
 },
 {
  "id": "sce373:01093",
  "jp": "セリカ「トウヤ！　ダメって言ってるでしょ！{nl}　調整が終わってないんだから！」",
  "off": 4243,
  "len": 48,
  "en": "Celica: Touya! I told you no! The tune-up isn't finished!",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 4245,
  "text_len": 45
 },
 {
  "id": "sce373:010C6",
  "jp": "トウヤ「ヤツに対抗できるのはライブレードしかねぇ！」",
  "off": 4294,
  "len": 33,
  "en": "Touya: Rayblade's the only thing that can stand up to that guy!",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 4296,
  "text_len": 30
 },
 {
  "id": "sce373:010F4",
  "jp": "整備士A「チーフ！　対フィールドユニットが{nl}　起動するのは二機だけです！　{nl}　あとはまだ使えません！」",
  "off": 4340,
  "len": 68,
  "en": "",
  "status": "todo",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 4342,
  "text_len": 65
 },
 {
  "id": "sce373:0113B",
  "jp": "トウヤ「だったらなおさらだ。{nl}　なんといっても俺は出るぞ！」",
  "off": 4411,
  "len": 36,
  "en": "Touya: All the more reason. No matter what, I'm going out!",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 4413,
  "text_len": 33
 },
 {
  "id": "sce373:0118B",
  "jp": "セリカ「‥‥じゃ、私が乗る」",
  "off": 4491,
  "len": 21,
  "en": "Celica: ...Then I'll ride with you.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 4493,
  "text_len": 18
 },
 {
  "id": "sce373:011A3",
  "jp": "トウヤ「え？」",
  "off": 4515,
  "len": 11,
  "en": "Touya: Huh?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 4517,
  "text_len": 8
 },
 {
  "id": "sce373:011C3",
  "jp": "セリカ「ライブレードが二人乗りだってこと忘れた？{nl}　それにサポートプログラムが正常に動かないの。{nl}　だから私がその代わりをするわ」",
  "off": 4547,
  "len": 80,
  "en": "Celica: Did you forget Rayblade's a two-seater? Besides, the support program isn't working right. So I'll take its place.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 4549,
  "text_len": 77
 },
 {
  "id": "sce373:01216",
  "jp": "トウヤ「‥‥わかった。サポートは任せた！」",
  "off": 4630,
  "len": 29,
  "en": "Touya: ...Got it. I'm leaving the support to you!",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 4632,
  "text_len": 26
 },
 {
  "id": "sce373:01248",
  "jp": "セリカ「ええ！　あと、ライブレードには剣がないから{nl}　ゼイフォンのを使って！」",
  "off": 4680,
  "len": 47,
  "en": "Celica: Right! Also, Rayblade doesn't have a sword, so use Zeifon's!",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 4682,
  "text_len": 44
 },
 {
  "id": "sce373:01285",
  "jp": "トウヤ「了解！　それじゃ、新生ライブレードの{nl}　お披露目だ！　‥‥いくぜっ‼」",
  "off": 4741,
  "len": 55,
  "en": "Touya: Roger! All right, time to show off the reborn Rayblade! ...Here we go!!",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 4743,
  "text_len": 52
 },
 {
  "id": "sce373:012EE",
  "jp": "レデュース「ガリュード様、我々も出ましょう！」",
  "off": 4846,
  "len": 32,
  "en": "",
  "status": "todo",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 4848,
  "text_len": 29
 },
 {
  "id": "sce373:01311",
  "jp": "ガリュード「うむ。だが、お前はここに残れ。{nl}　そして、シエルを守ってほしい」",
  "off": 4881,
  "len": 45,
  "en": "",
  "status": "todo",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 4883,
  "text_len": 42
 },
 {
  "id": "sce373:01341",
  "jp": "レデュース「‥‥それはいったいどういう意味ですか？」",
  "off": 4929,
  "len": 35,
  "en": "",
  "status": "todo",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 4931,
  "text_len": 32
 },
 {
  "id": "sce373:01367",
  "jp": "ガリュード「時がくれば話す。{nl}　だが、今は黙って従ってはくれぬか？」",
  "off": 4967,
  "len": 44,
  "en": "",
  "status": "todo",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 4969,
  "text_len": 41
 },
 {
  "id": "sce373:01396",
  "jp": "レデュース「‥‥わかりました。{nl}　しかし、ならば私よりもガリュード様のほうが適任かと」",
  "off": 5014,
  "len": 54,
  "en": "",
  "status": "todo",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 5016,
  "text_len": 51
 },
 {
  "id": "sce373:013CF",
  "jp": "ガリュード「自信がないか？」",
  "off": 5071,
  "len": 21,
  "en": "",
  "status": "todo",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 5073,
  "text_len": 18
 },
